title: Underpass_TooDark
---
The underpass is black. Not dark like night. Dark like a hole in the world.
You take one step in, and your legs refuse the second.
You'd need more nerve than you have. Or a real light.
===
title: Underpass_Bells
---
Out of the underpass, the sound of the street drops away.
Then, from somewhere ahead, bells. Small ones, the kind that hang on a shop door.
You don't turn around.
<<if met("bond:kenta >= 1")>>
Kenta will want to hear about this.
<<endif>>
<<flag clue_underpass_bells>>
===
